Fleet Carrier - bay beacon for Fleet Miner drones on a MOVING carrier.
SETUP: PB + antenna on the carrier. Name the drone docking connectors with
the tag ([FM]); each is a bay. Optional: a cockpit/remote control on the
carrier gives exact velocities (otherwise they are estimated).
Custom Data [Carrier] Channel must match the drones' [Fleet] Channel.
Fly the carrier however you like (player or autopilot); drones follow it.
LCD: name an LCD [FM Bays] ([Carrier] DisplayTag) for bays + docked drones. RESCAN.
Limit: at most ~20 bays per channel (IGC queues 25 messages per listener).
